Z||000005||DaRkLoRD||09-08-2000||08:29 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Coconut:<BR><B>Oh,BTW.... Darklord, thanks for sending the cards!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> We got them about 2 weeks back and have distributed a few already. Steve, ya did an AWESOME job with those cards. Quality was better than I had anticipated! Thanks a bunch. <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thanks for the kind words.. hehe.. I'm glad you like the cards!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>When I moved to college 3 weeks ago, I left my business files at home... so I currently have no record of who I still need to send cards to.. so if you've asked for some and haven't received any yet, EMAIL ME AGAIN!!<P>anyway, welcome back.. I was offline for about 2 weeks as well, so I know how you felt..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||10
