Z||000007||tgowens||09-09-2000||01:55 AM||||Hey Coconut and FieroGTGirl!!! Welcome back!! I made a move too - came back to CA from Ky about a couple of weeks ago -- I am in Richmond, CA working at the Fiero Shop!! Give me a call down here sometime -- the number is 510-23-FIERO (510-233-4376)....It seems like all we have done since I have been here is 3.4 engine swaps!! All of a sudden everybody wants one!! -- It was a good move tho and not only am I learning more about working on the Fiero but I bought another one -- a blue '87GT that I will be making into a modified custom show car over the course of the next six months or so..<P>Hope to meet you guys someday (you could always come down for the Western Regional Fiero Fest next July!!! - Our club, Golden Gate Fieros is hosting the show.........)<P>Anyway, welcome back - I sure have missed ya'll (old southern word) around here!!<P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/Terry_sig.gif">                    <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A><BR>Gold '87 GT<BR>Blue '87 GT||||reg||1
